## Partner Program Metrics That Matter

Track these monthly:

| Metric | Why It Matters |
|---|---|
| Active partners (referred ≥1 lead in period) | Tells you if the program is alive or dormant |
| Leads referred | Volume coming through the channel |
| Deals registered | Partners engaging seriously with your program |
| Deals closed | Actual revenue from the channel |
| Recurring commission paid | Ongoing value to partners — drives retention |
| Revenue per active partner | Efficiency of the channel |
| Partner satisfaction / retention | Leading indicator of long-term channel health |

A partner program with 10 active partners referring 5 leads/month and closing 2 deals/month with recurring commissions is a real revenue channel. A partner program with 50 signed-up partners and 1 active referrer is a vanity asset.

